---
description: Deploy every commit to the public Flick URL
alwaysApply: true
---

After committing and pushing Flick changes, they must appear on
https://temporary-brisk-mesa-ty777ur.vercel.app/

That Vercel project is claimed. Anonymous `vercel deploy --temporary` no
longer works.

- Prefer the GitHub repo `ShaharShokrani/flick` connected to that project
  in the Vercel dashboard (Settings → Git). Then `git push` publishes it.
- Or set `VERCEL_TOKEN` and `VERCEL_ORG_ID` and run `npm run deploy`.
  `.githooks/pre-push` uses the same script.
- Do not commit `.vercel/anonymous.json` or Vercel tokens.
- Set `SKIP_DEPLOY=1` only when a push must skip the deploy attempt.
